      en: ["Suncheon Bay encompasses approximately 5.4 square kilometers of reed fields.", "Suncheonman Bay National Garden became Korea's first national garden in 2015.", "Naganeupseong Folk Village was originally established as a fortress in 1397.", "Over 200 bird species use Suncheon Bay as a migratory stopover.", "Songgwangsa Temple is one of the three 'Jewel Temples' of Korean Buddhism.", "The city was designated as a UNESCO Biosphere Reserve in 2018."],
      es: ["Población: aprox. 270.000", "Superficie: 907 km²", "Bahía de Suncheon: 27,6 km²", "Especies de aves migratorias: más de 200", "Naganeupseong: 120 casas tradicionales", "Área del jardín: 1,12 km²"],
      pt: ["População: aprox. 270.000", "Área: 907 km²", "Baía de Suncheon: 27,6 km²", "Espécies de aves migratórias: mais de 200", "Naganeupseong: 120 casas tradicionais", "Área do jardim: 1,12 km²"],
      fr: ["Population : env. 270 000", "Superficie : 907 km²", "Baie de Suncheon : 27,6 km²", "Espèces d'oiseaux migrateurs : plus de 200", "Naganeupseong : 120 maisons traditionnelles", "Superficie du jardin : 1,12 km²"],
