      en: ["Gyeongju served as the capital of Silla for exactly 992 years.", "The Cheomseongdae observatory is constructed from 365 stone blocks.", "Bulguksa Temple and Seokguram Grotto were designated UNESCO sites in 1995.", "Anapji Pond was constructed in 674 AD as part of the royal palace garden.", "Daereungwon Park contains 23 monumental royal burial mounds.", "The city has over 250,000 residents and is a hub for the automotive industry."],
