      en: ["Icheon was the first Korean city to join the UNESCO Creative Cities Network.", "The ceramics village is home to over 300 pottery studios.", "Icheon rice was historically supplied to the royal court of the Joseon Dynasty.", "Icheon Termeden is Korea's first German-style thermal hot spring resort.", "Seolbong Lake in the city center is a popular local recreational spot.", "The headquarters of SK Hynix, a global semiconductor leader, is located here."],
